    "source_text": "In a 50 mL round-bottomed flask (t=g) was 4-fluoro-N-methylaniline (.05 g, 0.40 mmol), 3,5-dibromopyridine (0.114 g, 0.48 mmol), and Pd2(dba)3 (0.018 g, 0.02 mmol) in toluene (16 mL) ([VOLUME]) to give a purple suspension. biphenyl-2-yldicyclohexylphosphine (0.021 g, 0.06 mmol) and CS2CO3 (0.195 g, 0.60 mmol) were added.  After LC/MS indicated no reaction had taken place at room temp, the temperature was gradually rasied to up to 110 degrees. LC/MS indicated that the reaction was not progressing.  Reaction was discarded.  ",
